n personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_mTu20Kf1w8Q7kNvwF30Bfd&_nc_oc=Adku1BzgWst0_Q46HGwwBwJzgviD_u73HbuYNwmS78GVrPoO8vJlLOd8NWXbv07sVhA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftQYu9pVvLRPsL_cQIEtuGgwv0e5TqKExdqxYk06eFFhQ&oe=699AE601"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-JbKTTaqYZMQ7kNvwG-SDAQ&_nc_oc=Adk39GRswd2tK56TJxNIEkMaH1uD8XDAi_dvjSuCanVwY9cmo6eHLQPezQbyanUU3wc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu4FaT3nnikl91A0hmKHjIIczGDXRvqbbR3izJBnKgwGw&oe=699AF366"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yHiCgjgpHdwQ7kNvwH23LoL&_nc_oc=AdlKeqXj8JCwnZdVkBW54eai7GmLIbYKjOWWww-BZm_e8MFDZnLEapFScLiVdNR3cyU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuScUZybRO5FclSjpjWzCYnBwDwqNFyldNwbvNAYaEazw&oe=699AFD5C"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_HeroCover_3000x900FRA_v01.png", "id": "1082217212393113", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974873_1082217215726446_517494784553485669_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g7IKdTWCiUYQ7kNvwHBYlHs&_nc_oc=AdkW4CKjr7yEH